  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1: RetrievalPipeline no longer re-sorts single-variant results by score. It now preserves the connector's native relevance order, because MEVD scores mean \"higher = better\" only for similarity functions — distance functions (e.g. CosineDistance) invert that, and the old descending sort reversed distance results. 1.1.0: ProcessAsync and AsRetriever forward an optional MEVD VectorSearchOptions<TRecord> (metadata Filter + native ScoreThreshold) to the connector.",
